:re
if {false then 1} else
//│ ╔══[PARSE ERROR] Expected expression or block after `else` keyword; found end of input instead
//│ ║  l.+1: 	if {false then 1} else
//│ ╙──      	                      ^
//│ ═══[RUNTIME ERROR] This code cannot be run as its compilation yielded an error.


if (print("Hello World"); false)
  then ???
  else 1
//│ > Hello World
//│ = 1


